<title>USA: LIPA sets January 13 meeting.</title>
<headline>LIPA sets January 13 meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Long Island Power Authority said Monday its trustees have scheduled their next meeting for Monday, January 13, at 1000 EST/1500 GMT.</p>
<p>LIPA said the meeting will be held at the OMNI in Uniondale, N.Y.</p>
<p>The authority was formed to study a state takeover of Long Island Lighting Co. Last month, Lilco agreed to be acquired by Brooklyn Union Gas Co.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
